      {
        "id": "example-explanation",
        "kind": "comment",
        "comment_auto_size": false,
        "text": "Jacobi Elliptic — reference 1\nEvaluates Jacobi cn, dn, sn and continuous amplitude phi for real x and parameter m=k (not k squared and not the modulus).\nEntrées -> opération -> indicateurs. Résultat attendu : output-cn (f64) = 1.0\noutput-dn (f64) = 1.0\noutput-sn (f64) = 0.0\noutput-amplitude (f64) = 0.0\n",
        "vertical_arrangement": "none",
